The '''Tano family''' were a [[Togruta]] family from the [[planet]] [[Shili]].<ref name="TOTJ" /> The most prominent member of the family was [[Ahsoka Tano]], a [[Force-sensitive]] [[Gender|female]] who was taken by [[Jedi Master]] [[Plo Koon]] to the [[Imperial Palace|Jedi Temple]] on [[Coruscant]] at a young age to be [[Jedi training|trained]] in the ways of [[the Force]] as a [[Jedi]].<ref name="RisingMalevolence">{{TCW|Rising Malevolence|Rising ''Malevolence''}}</ref> Tano would go on to become the [[Padawan|Jedi Padawan]] of the prophesized [[Chosen One]], [[Jedi Knight]] [[Anakin Skywalker]], during [[the galaxy]]-wide conflict known as the [[Clone Wars]].<ref name="TCWFilm" /> She served as a [[Jedi Commander]] in the [[501st Legion]] of the [[Grand Army of the Republic]] during the war and fought in many conflicts until she left the [[Jedi Order]] after being wrongly accused of the [[Bombing of the Jedi Temple hangar|bombing]] of the Jedi Temple.<ref name="TheWrongJedi">{{TCW|The Wrong Jedi}}</ref> Tano would later be instrumental in forming a [[Bail Organa's resistance movement|network]] of multiple rebel cells [[Early rebellion against the Galactic Empire|against]] the [[Galactic Empire]].<ref name="Fire">{{Rebels|Fire Across the Galaxy}}</ref>

Ahsoka Tano's parents were [[Pav-ti Tano]] and [[Nak-il Tano]]. Pav-ti, Tano's mother, was a believer in traditional Togruta custom, taking her infant daughter on a ritual hunt in Shili's [[forest]]s. Tano's father, Nak-il, believed that these customs were old fashioned however.<ref name="TOTJ" />

